  Two things to be aware of:

  - No archive table was included — this is a straight drop, so the [38;5;153mnotes[39m values in the 48,000 production rows are gone
    once the deploy job runs.
  - My local SQLite is 3.51.0, so [38;5;153mDROP COLUMN[39m is supported here. That's not evidence about production's version; if the
    deploy host is below 3.35.0 this migration will error out (harmlessly, before changing anything) and would need a
    table-rebuild instead.

